menu "ESP32-P4 platform audio"
    config PLATFORM_AUDIO_ELECROW_10_1_REVIEWED_BUILD_ONLY
        bool "Compile the reviewed Elecrow factory direct-I2S candidate"
        default n
        help
            Enables only the factory-matched direct-I2S candidate for the
            connected population:
            I2S1, GPIO21/22/23, no MCLK, and active-low GPIO30 amplifier
            control. The caller/display owns already-on LDO3/LDO4. This option
            is a build gate, not proof of audible output or permission to
            flash or energize speakers.
endmenu
